Grants and kill switch
Core's level: Permissive · Kill switch: on

Turn the kill switch off?
Turns are sent to the model again, in Codex and Claude panes, but nothing restarts on
its own: no pane starts a turn, stopped replies and commands do not restart, and paused
assignments and whips stay paused until you resume them. Messages and tasks from other
agents that waited go with each pane's next turn, when someone types in it or it gets new
work. Protected actions can be approved again and grants can be issued. Revoked grants and
approvals do not come back.
The level stays Permissive: turning the kill switch off never lowers it.

› Back (the kill switch stays on)
  Turn the kill switch off

↑/↓ choose · enter confirm · esc cancel, nothing changes
